<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups Micron Tech.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups Micron Tech.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston analyst Jack Geraghty upgraded Micron Technology Inc to buy from hold, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst declined to comment.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
